    "body": "fix on issue/1444-slot-undercut · PR #2714 · pinned by `undercut_laws` (sim, 14 tests), `machining2d::undercut::tests` (motion, 8 tests), `undercut::tests` (tools, 7 tests), `mcp_slot_undercut` (app, 5 tests), `golden_undercut` (app, 4 golden CL files) · merges at the next cut\n\nTwo notes for the maintainer:\n\n- The issue asks for a Perplexity literature search first. This session had no web tool, so no search was run. The PR body and `docs/decisions/1444-slot-undercut.md` name the published sources that the code was written from.\n- The PR adds the four cutter kinds that this issue needs (T-slot, keyseat, dovetail, lollipop). Issue #896 stays open for the drawn form cutters.\n",
